  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Emergency Assistance</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="FR">Protection, Assistance et Solutions</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="FR">La fourniture d&apos;une protection efficace, d&apos;une assistance et de solutions durables aux r&#xe9;fugi&#xe9;s, aux personnes d&#xe9;plac&#xe9;es &#xe0; l&apos;int&#xe9;rieur de leur propre pays (PDI) et aux autres victimes de conflits et de catastrophes.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Program aims to enhance safe, effective, and efficient passenger and light humanitarian cargo (eg. Medical supplies) transport services. Provides support to UNHAS (un humanitarian air service) with goal of increasing timely responses to medical and security evacuations.</narrative>
  </description>
